OL,3,ARobot vessels take on the dangerous
OL,4,Awork of mine hunting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraversing the Strait of Hormuz remains
OL,7,Fone of the most dangerous trips a
OL,8,Fvessel can take.
OL,10,FDespite assistance from the US Navy,
OL,11,Fships are still being attacked.
OL,13,F"To transit the Strait of Hormuz you
OL,14,Fneed agreement between the captain and
OL,15,Fthe crew to take the risk. You need war
OL,16,Frisk insurance. And the captain has to
OL,17,Fmake the final decision," says Steve
OL,18,FCameron, a former merchant navy officer
OL,19,Fand maritime consultant.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
